      "content": "Can you go into more detail on the critics' side though? I want to make sure I'm not missing the weight of their arguments. Some of the energy groups are saying that the transition timeline is fundamentally incompatible with current battery storage technology and that the costs will hit low-income households hardest. How legitimate are those specific economic and technical fears compared to the projected benefits the proponents are talking about?",
